    {
      "key": "POST /api/alerts/configuration",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/alerts/configuration",
      "transport": "http-rest",
      "operation": {
        "callbacks": {},
        "description": "Creates a new alert configuration, or updates an existing one when `id` is given.\n\nThe alert filters can be given in one of two ways, but never both:\n- `config`: a structured filter object for the given `noti_type`, the same configuration as returned by the alert configurations endpoint.\n- `input`: a Query language expression. Use the Query language for complex filter expressions.\n\nBefore creating an alert fetch the available filters:\n- `GET /api/alerts/filters` lists per alert type (`noti_type`) the filter fields that can be used in `config`, their accepted values, and whether your account can create alerts of that type.\n- `GET /api/alerts/query/grammar` returns the Query language syntax. `GET /api/alerts/query/grammar?target=option_trade` the full field reference for one target.\n\nExample with a structured `config`:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"FED news\",\n  \"noti_type\": \"news\",\n  \"config\": {\"symbols\": \"all\", \"contains\": [\"FED\"]}\n}\n```\n\nExample with a Query language `input`:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Energy sector calls\",\n  \"noti_type\": \"flow_alerts\",\n  \"input\": \"add @energy where calls and volume > 100 and (dte > 10 or (dte = 0 and ticker = 'XOM'))\"\n}\n```\n\nThe created alerts are delivered like the alerts created on [https://unusualwhales.com/custom-alerts](https://unusualwhales.com/custom-alerts)\nand their triggers can be fetched from the alerts endpoint or streamed over the `custom_alerts` websocket channel.\n\nThe alerts and usage of the websocket are the easiest way to setup and get notified on anything that matches your filter configs.\nThe query language is a powerful tool to create complex configurations in a SQL like language.\n",
        "operationId": "PublicApi.AlertsController.create_config",
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "description": "Creates a new alert configuration, or updates an existing one when `id` is given.\n\nThe alert filters can be given in one of two ways, but never both:\n- `config`: a structured filter object for the given `noti_type`. Fetch the available filter fields per alert type from `GET /api/alerts/filters`.\n- `input`: a DSL expression such as `add @energy where calls and volume > 100`. Fetch the DSL grammar from `GET /api/alerts/query/grammar`. The `noti_type` field is required for DSL expressions.\n",
                "example": {
                  "input": "add @energy where calls and volume > 100",
                  "name": "Energy call sweeps",
                  "noti_type": "flow_alerts"
                },
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "required": [
                      "name",
                      "noti_type",
                      "config"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "required": [
                      "name",
                      "noti_type",
                      "input"
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "config": {
                    "description": "An alert configuration, there is no fixed schema for this as each alert will have a different configuration.",
                    "example": {
                      "config": {
                        "option_symbols": [
                          "TGT241122C00177500"
                        ],
                        "symbols": "all"
                      }
                    },
                    "title": "The configuration of an alert.",
                    "type": "object"
                  },
                  "id": {
                    "description": "When given, updates the existing alert configuration with this id instead of creating a new one.",
                    "format": "uuid",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "input": {
                    "description": "A DSL expression describing the alert filters. Use instead of `config` for complex filter expressions. See the DSL grammar endpoint for the syntax.",
                    "example": "where calls and volume > 100 and premium > 10000",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "description": "",
                    "example": "Chain OI Chg: TGT241122C00177500",
                    "title": "The name of the alert",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "noti_type": {
                    "description": "",
                    "example": "chain_oi_change",
                    "title": "The type of the alert",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "status": {
                    "description": "",
                    "enum": [
                      "active",
                      "rate_limit",
                      "paused"
                    ],
                    "example": "active",
                    "title": "The status of the alert",
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "title": "Create alert config request",
                "type": "object"
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "Alert configuration",
          "required": false
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "description": "The created or updated alert configuration",
                  "example": {
                    "data": {
                      "config": {
                        "expression": {
                          "op": "and",
                          "terms": [
                            {
                              "sectors": [
                                "Energy"
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "and",
                              "terms": [
                                {
                                  "is_call": true
                                },
                                {
                                  "compare": {
                                    "lhs": {
                                      "field": "volume"
                                    },
                                    "op": "gt",
                                    "rhs": {
                                      "literal": "100"
                                    }
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        "symbols": "all"
                      },
                      "created_at": "2025-07-01 14:00:00+00:00",
                      "dsl": "@Energy where calls and volume > 100",
                      "id": "ebe24953-a0bf-4b4d-98be-14f721a1199a",
                      "name": "Energy call sweeps",
                      "noti_type": "flow_alerts",
                      "status": "active"
                    }
                  },
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "properties": {
                        "config": {
                          "description": "An alert configuration, there is no fixed schema for this as each alert will have a different configuration.",
                          "example": {
                            "config": {
                              "option_symbols": [
                                "TGT241122C00177500"
                              ],
                              "symbols": "all"
                            }
                          },
                          "title": "The configuration of an alert.",
                          "type": "object"
                        },
                        "created_at": {
                          "description": "",
                          "example": "2024-11-19 18:19:14+00:00",
                          "title": "The creation timestamp",
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "dsl": {
                          "description": "The canonical DSL representation when the configuration was created or updated using `input`.",
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "id": {
                          "description": "",
                          "example": "ebe24953-a0bf-4b4d-98be-14f721a1199a",
                          "title": "The alert id",
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "name": {
                          "description": "",
                          "example": "Chain OI Chg: TGT241122C00177500",
                          "title": "The name of the alert",
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "noti_type": {
                          "description": "",
                          "example": "chain_oi_change",
                          "title": "The type of the alert",
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "status": {
                          "description": "",
                          "enum": [
                            "active",
                            "rate_limit",
                            "paused"
                          ],
                          "example": "active",
                          "title": "The status of the alert",
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "data"
                  ],
                  "title": "Created alert config",
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "The created or updated alert configuration"
          },
